  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n__Given Equation__: \n\n64 % 8 % 3 % 6 % 4 % 8 % 2\n\n**1)**** ÷, ×, +, =, ̶ , + →**\n\n⇒ 64 ÷ 8 × 3 + 6 = 4 - 8 + 2\n\n⇒ 8 × 3 + 6 = 4 - 8 + 2\n\n⇒ 24 + 6 = 4 - 8 + 2\n\n⇒ 30 ≠ -2\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2) **+, ×, =, ̶ , ÷ , + →**\n\n⇒ 64 + 8 × 3 = 6 - 4 ÷ 8 + 2\n\n⇒ 64 + 24 = 6 - 0.5 + 2\n\n⇒ 88 = 8 - 0.5 \n\n⇒ 88 ≠ 7.5\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3) **÷, ×, +, =, ×, ̶ →**\n\n**⇒ 64 ÷ 8 × 3 + 6 = 4 × 8 - 2**\n\n**⇒ 8 × 3 + 6 = 4 × 8 - 2**\n\n**⇒ 24 + 6 = 32 - 2**\n\n**⇒ 30 = 30**\n\n→ LHS = RHS → Satisfies the equation.\n\n4) **×, ÷, =, ̶ , +, × →**\n\n⇒ 64 × 8 ÷ 3 = 6 - 4 + 8 × 2\n\n⇒ 170.24 = 6 - 4 + 8 × 2\n\n⇒ 170.24 = 6 - 4 + 16\n\n​⇒ 170.24 = 22 - 4 \n\n170.24 ≠ 18 \n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"÷, ×, +, =, ×, ̶ \".\n\n5b:T2",
